---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { FOUNDER_LINKEDIN, FOUNDER_NAME, FOUNDER_ROLE, WHATSAPP_BASE_URL } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About Xpandor | Retail Expansion Partners"
	description="Learn how Xpandor takes ownership of the operational complexity behind physical retail expansion across Bengaluru and South India."
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="hero-content">
				<span class="eyebrow">ABOUT XPANDOR</span>
				<h1 class="page-title">The operational partner behind physical retail expansion.</h1>
				<p class="page-subhead">
					We built Xpandor around a simple reality: expanding a retail brand into new physical locations shouldn't require managing seven disconnected vendors.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- The Thesis -->
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="manifesto-card">
				<span class="eyebrow">Our Master Thesis</span>
				<blockquote class="manifesto-quote">
					“Xpandor takes ownership of the operational complexity behind physical expansion. A brand wants to go from ‘We want to open in Bengaluru’ to ‘Our store is open and trading.’ We manage the difficult middle.”
				</blockquote>
				<p class="manifesto-body">
					In traditional retail growth, a brand must separately source a broker, negotiate a landlord lease, brief an architect, bid out a general contractor, coordinate MEP engineers, commission a signboard maker, and instruct a staffing recruiter. The problem is not that these specialists don't exist; the problem is that the head of expansion has to coordinate all of them, resulting in communication gaps, duplicated work, and unaccountable delays.
				</p>
				<p class="manifesto-body">
					Xpandor brings all of that work under one roof: <strong>One client. One expansion team. One accountable partner.</strong>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- The 4 Differentiators -->
	<section class="section diff-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-header">
				<span class="eyebrow">Why We Are Different</span>
				<h2 class="section-title">Four core principles that guide our work.</h2>
				<p class="section-desc">
					We don't call ourselves a generic turnkey agency. Our differentiation is built on tangible on-ground advantages.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="grid-2">
				<div class="card-glass">
					<span class="diff-num">01</span>
					<h3 class="diff-title">Ground-Level Intelligence</h3>
					<p class="diff-text">
						We don't just browse public property aggregators. We cultivate direct on-ground relationships with building owners, local commercial brokers, shopkeepers, building managers, and local operators. This gives our clients access to off-market retail spaces before leases expire.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="card-glass">
					<span class="diff-num">02</span>
					<h3 class="diff-title">Commercial Understanding</h3>
					<p class="diff-text">
						Our objective isn't merely to find an attractive storefront. It is to find a commercial space that works for that particular retailer's unit economics: sustainable rent-to-sales ratios, proper frontage width, pedestrian footfall, and favorable lease structures.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="card-glass">
					<span class="diff-num">03</span>
					<h3 class="diff-title">Execution Ownership</h3>
					<p class="diff-text">
						Our team directly controls the entire project chain: scope definition, BOQ pricing, vendor management, on-site supervision, line-by-line quality inspection, and client updates. When a specialist trade executes on site, Xpandor retains total delivery accountability.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="card-glass">
					<span class="diff-num">04</span>
					<h3 class="diff-title">One Accountable Team</h3>
					<p class="diff-text">
						You never have to mediate between an architect blaming a contractor, or a contractor blaming a signmaker. You have one senior point of contact who owns the target opening date from initial site search to open trading doors.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Leadership & Accountability -->
	<section class="section leadership-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="leadership-box">
				<div class="leader-info">
					<span class="eyebrow">Expansion Leadership</span>
					<h2 class="section-title">{FOUNDER_NAME}</h2>
					<p class="leader-role">{FOUNDER_ROLE}</p>
					<p class="leader-bio">
						Preetham founded Xpandor to eliminate the operational chaos that retail founders and expansion heads face when scaling offline. Having managed physical retail expansions, commercial siting, fit-out execution, and retail team recruitment across South India, Preetham provides hands-on oversight on every client project.
					</p>
					<div class="leader-links">
						<a href={FOUNDER_LINKEDIN} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-gold">
							<span>Connect on LinkedIn ↗</span>
						</a>
						<a 
							href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20connect%20regarding%20retail%20expansion.`}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn btn-gold"
						>
							<span>Direct WhatsApp Message ↗</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="geo-focus-card">
					<span class="geo-title">Geographic Footprint</span>
					<div class="geo-item">
						<strong>Bengaluru-First:</strong>
						<p>Deep hyper-local commercial intelligence across Indiranagar, Koramangala, HSR Layout, Whitefield, Jayanagar, MG Road, and prime shopping concourses.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="geo-item">
						<strong>South India Capable:</strong>
						<p>Execution capability across Chennai, Hyderabad, Kochi, Coimbatore, and Tier-2 growth corridors for multi-store regional rollouts.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CTA -->
	<section class="section cta-section">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<div class="cta-banner mx-auto">
				<span class="eyebrow">Expand With Xpandor</span>
				<h2 class="cta-title">Let's discuss your brand's expansion.</h2>
				<p class="cta-desc">
					Whether you are an enterprise retail chain, a funded D2C brand moving offline, or an international brand entering South India, we are ready to partner.
				</p>
				<a 
					href={`${WHATSAPP_BASE_URL}?text=Hi%20Preetham,%20I'd%20like%20to%20discuss%20partnering%20with%20Xpandor%20for%20our%20retail%20growth.`}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="btn btn-gold btn-large"
				>
					<span>Connect with Preetham on WhatsApp ↗</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page-hero {
		padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
	}

	.hero-content {
		max-width: 820px;
	}

	.page-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
	}

	.page-subhead {
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.manifesto-card {
		background: var(--bg-surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: 3.5rem;
		max-width: 960px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.manifesto-card {
			padding: 1.75rem;
		}
	}

	.manifesto-quote {
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.65rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.45;
		color: var(--text-main);
		margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	.manifesto-body {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.75;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.diff-section {
		background: #06080E;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
	}

	.grid-2 {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.grid-2 {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.diff-num {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.diff-title {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
	}

	.diff-text {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.65;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Leadership Section */
	.leadership-box {
		background: var(--bg-surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: 3.5rem;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
		gap: 3.5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.leadership-box {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}

	.leader-role {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		margin: -0.5rem 0 1.25rem;
	}

	.leader-bio {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.leader-links {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.geo-focus-card {
		background: #06080E;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
		border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
		padding: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.geo-title {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		color: var(--accent-gold);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.geo-item strong {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
		margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
	}

	.geo-item p {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.cta-banner {
		background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.12) 0%, rgba(8, 10, 16, 0) 70%), var(--bg-surface-card);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: 4.5rem 2rem;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
	}

	.cta-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.cta-desc {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.btn-large {
		padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
	}

	.text-center {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.mx-auto {
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}
</style>
